und keys. The keys in the game are very heavy, and the only way to get the key closer to the door is to switch gravity.<br>You will also need to guide, push keys and stones with the help of a super durable cosmetic ship controlled by a rabbit.<br><br>Game features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Adventure with changing gravity, be careful with these!<br></li><li>Collecting carrots is very important. Rabbit knows about the benefits of carrots, do you?<br></li><li>Super durable ship capable of moving huge keys. Moving stones in flight is easier than rolling surfaces.<br></li><li>Convenient controls, arrows and space bar.<br></li><li>Challenging levels, doors, gravity and hidden carrots.<br></li><li>Carrots are money, now imagine a world in which carrots are a very important element of the economy! In the game Gravity_Kid, carrots are really very important.</li></ul>", "short_description": "A rabbit on a rocket that can change gravity!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Portuguese - Brazil, Hungarian, Vietnamese, Greek, Danish, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Finnish, Czech, Swedish, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1415750/header.jpg?t=1602073688", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1415750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1602073688", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1415750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1602073688", "website": "https://www.facebook.com/DnovelGames/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel x86 family, 2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> opengl 2.0 supported graphics card<br></li>